WEBVTT

00:03:57.839 --> 00:04:02.688
We must harness that same
spirit of human ingenuity and purpose

00:04:02.712 --> 00:04:05.925
and turn it with laser sharp
focus and urgency

00:04:05.949 --> 00:04:09.126
on the most pressing challenge
we have ever faced,

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:11.253
repairing our planet.

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:14.948
The shared goals
for our generation are clear.

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:19.609
Together, we must protect
and restore nature,

00:04:19.633 --> 00:04:23.688
clean our air, revive our oceans,

00:04:23.712 --> 00:04:27.804
build a waste-free world
and fix our climate.

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:32.185
And we must strive
to do all of this in a decade.